---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    This gallery collects data projects in one place: interactive notebooks, apps
    and papers. The examples use synthetic data and are built to be reproduced.
  </p>
  <h2>How the projects are built</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Notebooks are written in <a href="https://marimo.io">marimo</a> or <a href="https://quarto.org">Quarto</a>, and apps in <a href="https://streamlit.io">Streamlit</a>.</li>
    <li>Papers are typeset with <a href="https://typst.app">Typst</a>.</li>
    <li>Python environments are managed with <a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/">uv</a>, so each project can be reproduced with <code>uv sync</code>.</li>
    <li>All source code is public on GitHub.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Find the code and open an issue or discussion on
    <a href="https://github.com/radek-dev">GitHub</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
